*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% Xerox Phaser 3020 - raw USB (Apple Raster wrapped in PJL)
*% https://github.com/atilac/xerox-phaser-3020-macos
*% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*FileSystem: False
*PCFileName: "XRXP3020.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Xerox"
*ModelName: "Xerox Phaser 3020"
*Product: (Xerox Phaser 3020)
*ShortNickName: "Xerox Phaser 3020 USB"
*NickName: "Xerox Phaser 3020 - USB (urftopjl)"
*Throughput: "21"
*cupsVersion: 2.0
*cupsModelNumber: 0
*cupsSNMPSupplies: False
*cupsSingleFile: True
*cupsMaxCopies: 255

*% The printer accepts URF over USB only when PJL announces it.
*cupsFilter2: "image/urf image/urf 10 /Library/Printers/Xerox/P3020/urftopjl"
*APURFVersion: 1.3
*APAcceptsMixedURF: True
*cupsUrfSupported: "W8,RS600,IS1,CP1,IFU0,PQ4,OB10,V1.3"

*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*OpenUI *ColorModel/Color Mode: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *ColorModel
*DefaultColorModel: Gray
*ColorModel Gray/Grayscale: "<</cupsColorSpace 18/cupsBitsPerColor 8/cupsColorOrder 0/cupsCompression 0>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *ColorModel

*DefaultResolution: 600x600dpi
*OpenUI *cupsPrintQuality/Quality: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *cupsPrintQuality
*DefaultcupsPrintQuality: Normal
*cupsPrintQuality Normal: "<</cupsInteger1 4 /HWResolution[600 600]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *cupsPrintQuality

*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*DefaultOutputOrder: Normal

*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
